---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="PharmDaily privacy policy: no accounts, no cookies, cookieless anonymous analytics only.">
  <article class="wrap measure page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="credit">Short version: no accounts, no cookies, and only anonymous visit counts.</p>
    <h2>No accounts</h2>
    <p>There is no sign-in. We never ask for your name, email or phone number.</p>
    <h2>No cookies</h2>
    <p>PharmDaily sets no cookies.</p>
    <h2>Your progress stays on your phone</h2>
    <p>Flashcard marks and MCQ answers are saved in your browser's local storage on your device only. They are never sent to us. Clearing your browser data, or tapping "Clear progress" or "Start again", removes them.</p>
    <h2>Anonymous analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Vercel Web Analytics to count page views. It is cookieless and does not identify you or follow you across other sites. We see totals such as which pages are visited and roughly which countries and devices visitors use.</p>
    <h2>Fonts and hosting</h2>
    <p>Fonts are served from this site, not from a third party. The site is hosted on Vercel, which processes standard web requests to deliver the pages.</p>
    <h2>No ads</h2>
    <p>There are no ads and no other trackers.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
